❤️ Recommended Learning Path

✔ Start from Problem 1–20 → Basics
✔ Then practice 21–40 → Arrays, Strings, OOP
✔ Then 41–60 → Inheritance, Interface, Collections
✔ Then 61–75 → Streams, File Handling, Spring Boot